  "text": "The raven leaves its mark on a Celtic tale of love. A woman saw a feather and a drop of blood on snow. She wished for a man whose hair was black like that raven. She wanted his skin white and his lips red. The bard Leborcham guided her to the man who fit the wish. That man bore the name Noísiu.",
